<item><title>Tiris-Zemour governor orders gold miners out of 10-kilometre border zone</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/tiris-zemour-governor-orders-gold-miners-out-of-10-2e4461/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/tiris-zemour-governor-orders-gold-miners-out-of-10-2e4461/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>Idriss Demba Corera gave prospectors up to two weeks to leave sites inside Mauritania, citing border security and protection for miners.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:38:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" length="34560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritania approves decree regulating medicine promotion and advertising</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-approves-decree-regulating-medicine-promotion-805ae8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-approves-decree-regulating-medicine-promotion-805ae8/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>The rules cover promotion to health professionals, public advertising and prior permits for pharmaceutical information activities.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:13:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" length="34560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritania and Morocco revive 1986 trade pact and plan Nouakchott wholesale market</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-and-morocco-revive-1986-trade-pact-and-plan-6c5561/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-and-morocco-revive-1986-trade-pact-and-plan-6c5561/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>The countries also agreed in principle to build a market with cold rooms and modern abattoirs, with technical studies due by the end of 2027.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:05:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-and-morocco-revive-1986-trade-pact-and-plan-6c5561/share.jpg" length="45501" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-and-morocco-revive-1986-trade-pact-and-plan-6c5561/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritania press group seeks withdrawal of media eligibility list</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-press-group-seeks-withdrawal-of-media-289a05/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-press-group-seeks-withdrawal-of-media-289a05/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>The Coordination of Professional Press Bodies says the regulator’s process excluded organisations and lacked consultation and transparency.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:50:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" length="34560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritania signs transplant accord with Italy’s Lazio centre</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-signs-transplant-accord-with-italy-s-lazio-centre-52d2ae/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-signs-transplant-accord-with-italy-s-lazio-centre-52d2ae/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>The agreement covers medical-team training, a kidney-transplant programme and technical support for the country’s first liver transplants.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:42:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" length="34560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
